      "description": {
        "en": "A transparent, always-on-top companion that stays on the desktop while DSH runs in the background. Left click for a 3-second panel, right click to pick the panel mode, drag to move. Panels: live session status, account balance plus context/token usage, and quick chat.",
        "zh-cn": "一只浮在桌面上的桌宠：DSH 在后台时它仍留在桌面上。左键压扁并唤出 3 秒面板，右键选择面板模式，按住可拖动。面板包含工作状态、账户余额与上下文/Token 用量、快速对话。"
